.TH FATHOM_MCP_APPROVAL_TOKEN 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-mcp\-approval\-token \- Mint the token that authorises `mark_reviewed` for exactly one change
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom mcp approval token\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fICHANGE_ID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mint the token that authorises `mark_reviewed` for exactly one change
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository whose `[mcp]` config holds the approval secret
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fICHANGE_ID\fR>
The change to bind the token to: an episode id or a commit
